---
// src/pages/aparelhos/celular-e-tablet.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cine VIP no Celular e Tablet: Android e iPhone (iOS) em 4K"
  description="Como assistir ao Cine VIP no celular Android e iPhone. Aplicativos recomendados, economia de dados no 4G/5G e teste grátis de 6h pelo WhatsApp."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Início', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Aparelhos', url: '/aparelhos/' },
    { name: 'Celular & Tablet', url: '/aparelhos/celular-e-tablet/' }
  ]}
>
  <article class="py-16 bg-[#030712]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <span class="text-xs font-black text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest bg-amber-400/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-500/20">
        Tutorial Mobile (Android & iOS)
      </span>
      
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mt-4 mb-6">
        Como Assistir ao Cine VIP no <span class="text-amber-400">Celular e Tablet</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 font-medium leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Tenha mais de 120 mil títulos e centenas de canais ao vivo no bolso. Assista onde estiver, seja pelo Wi-Fi ou na rede móvel (4G e 5G) com compressão inteligente H.265.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-[#080d1a] border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>🤖</span>
            <span>Para Celulares Android</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Baixe o aplicativo <strong>IPTV Smarters Pro</strong> ou <strong>XCIPTV</strong> direto da Google Play Store ou solicite nosso APK oficial otimizado.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#080d1a] border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>🍎</span>
            <span>Para iPhone e iPad (iOS)</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Baixe o aplicativo <strong>Smarters Player Lite</strong> ou <strong>GSE Smart IPTV</strong> na App Store oficial da Apple.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500/10 via-[#080d1a] to-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Quer testar no celular agora mesmo?</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6">Chame no WhatsApp +55 (11) 97200-8717 e receba as credenciais do seu teste VIP.</p>
        <a 
          href="/ir/teste-gratis/"
          class="inline-block px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-yellow-400 text-slate-950 font-black text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wider hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          Pedir Teste Mobile no WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

